sva.tooltip.vehicle.statsCrawler=Tier %s. Up to %s km/h, seats: %s, cargo: %s slots. Tracks: turns on the spot, steps up 2 blocks, swims across water.
sva.tooltip.details.truck=A tracked lorry: 54 slots in its bed and 54 more in the trailer; carries goods between two Coordinator points by itself.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.truck=Helium cools the motor above 40%% heat - with a full bed and trailer the motor heats up faster.
sva.tooltip.limits.truck=Out of charge - limp mode (10%% speed). At 100%% heat the motor stalls until it cools to 50%%. Swims across water at half speed, not lava. The trailer is drawn behind and never catches on blocks.
sva.tooltip.howto.truck2=W/S - throttle and reverse, A/D - turn (on the spot too), Space - brake. Shift+right-click - cargo: arrows switch bed / trailer, on the right - auto-delivery, the route, "Unhitch trailer".
sva.tooltip.howto.truck3=Trailer - right-click the crawler with a "Trailer" item. Auto-delivery: right-click the crawler with a core Coordinator - point A, once more - point B; then "Auto-delivery" in the cargo screen. At A it loads from a chest nearby (within 4 blocks), at B it unloads. Loaded chunks only, no path finding: straight at the point, steps up to 2 blocks; stuck for 10 s - it stops.
sva.tooltip.details.drill=A heavy tracked machine with a bore: 3x3 tunnels (5x5 with the "Bore Widener"), ore mining, levelling hills.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.drill=Helium cools the motor above 40%% heat. Argon feeds the hull field: 1 mB/s while the motor runs, hull damage -40%%.
sva.tooltip.limits.drill=The bore takes the core quarry's drill heads (steel, tungsten, diamond, Exo): x8 their quarry speed, hardness by the head, 1 wear a block, Exo lasts for ever (EU x1.5). EU a block as the quarry: 30 + 15 x hardness. Never touches bedrock, tile-entity blocks (chests, machines), other players' claims or spawn protection.
sva.tooltip.howto.drill2=W/S - drive, A/D - turn on the spot. "Drill" (%4$s) - on / off, "Drill mode" (%3$s) - Tunnel / Ore only / Level. The bore works while the vehicle drives forward. Shift+right-click - the bunker (108 slots, two pages), the drill head and module slots on the left.
sva.tooltip.howto.drill3=Rock and ore go into the bunker (full - the bore stops). Lava and water at the face are walled up with cobblestone from the bunker; in a dark tunnel a torch from the bunker goes down every 8 blocks. The operator sits high: his head above the cab roof, his eyes under a 3x3 tunnel's ceiling.
