sva.tooltip.trailer.summary=§7Cargo Crawler trailer: §f+%s cargo slots
sva.tooltip.trailer.cargo=§7Cargo: §f%s / %s
sva.tooltip.trailer.details=Carries its own cargo: unhitched, the goods stay in the trailer item; hitched again, they are back in the crawler's cargo. A crawler picked up keeps its trailer with everything in it.
sva.tooltip.trailer.howto=Right-click your Cargo Crawler to hitch it (the trailer appears behind, the cargo screen gets a "Trailer" page). Unhitch: the "Unhitch trailer" button in the cargo screen. Made on the Engineering Workbench.
