# ---- stage D: jet, tiltrotor
item.siliconagevehicles.vehicle.jet.name=Jet
item.siliconagevehicles.vehicle.tilt.name=Tiltrotor
sva.tooltip.details.jet=The fastest vehicle: up to 121 km/h, up to 180 on the afterburner. One seat: the hydrogen and helium tanks sit behind the pilot. Needs a runway or a long flat stretch.
sva.tooltip.energy.jet=Uses up to %1$s EU/t on the take-off run and climbing, %2$s EU/t cruising (20%% less above Y 100), %3$s EU/t on the ground. A full charge lasts ~%4$s blocks.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.jet=Afterburner: hydrogen %3$s mB/s, x%4$s speed and thrust, the engine heats twice as fast. Helium cools the motor above 40%% heat - a long afterburner run without it overheats the motor.
sva.tooltip.limits.jet=Take-off run ~50 blocks (~25 on a Runway). Below 65 km/h in the air - §estall§7. Without the motor - a 1:8 glide and a belly landing that wears the hull. Speed is capped at 180 km/h so the world ahead can load.
sva.tooltip.howto.jet2=W/S - throttle, A/D - banked turn, Space - pull up (lift-off from 72 km/h), Descend (%1$s) or sprint (Ctrl) - nose down. Boost (%2$s) at full throttle - afterburner. Shift+right-click - cargo.
sva.tooltip.howto.jet3=Hydrogen and helium - a cell / bucket or the Gas Column. Charging platform - 7x7 plates.
sva.tooltip.details.tilt=Takes off and lands like a helicopter, flies like a plane: no runway needed. The Mode key (%3$s) turns the nacelles - the transition takes 2 seconds.
sva.tooltip.energy.tilt=Uses: vertical mode - %5$s EU/t hovering, %6$s EU/t flying; airplane mode - up to %1$s EU/t climbing, %2$s EU/t cruising (20%% less above Y 100); %3$s EU/t on the ground. A full charge lasts ~%4$s blocks in airplane mode.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.tilt=Afterburner in airplane mode: hydrogen %3$s mB/s, x%4$s speed. Helium cools the motor above 40%% heat.
sva.tooltip.limits.tilt=Airplane mode only in the air: from 32 km/h or 6 blocks over the ground. Back to vertical - no faster than 52 km/h. In airplane mode below 43 km/h - §estall§7. Without power: autorotation in vertical mode, a glide in airplane mode.
sva.tooltip.howto.tilt2=Vertical mode - like a helicopter: Space up, Descend (%1$s) or sprint (Ctrl) down, W/S forward / back, A/D turn. Airplane mode - like a plane: W/S throttle, Space nose up. Mode (%3$s) - switch modes, Boost (%2$s) - afterburner in airplane mode.
sva.tooltip.howto.tilt3=Seats: 2 pilots and 4 in the troop bay. Charging platform - 5x5 plates. Hydrogen and helium - a cell / bucket or the Gas Column.
