sva.tooltip.trailerKindOn=§7Trailer: §f%s
sva.tooltip.trailer.tank.summary=§7Crawler tanker: §f16 000 mB of one fluid or gas
sva.tooltip.trailer.tank.in=§7Holds: §f%s, %s / %s mB
sva.tooltip.trailer.tank.none=§7Holds: §fempty
sva.tooltip.trailer.tank.details=One fluid at a time: water, lava, the Silicon Age gases (hydrogen, helium, oxygen, argon, deuterium...). Filled and emptied in the cargo screen, "Trailer" tab: a full container into the left slot, an empty one into the right (buckets, cells, tanks-in-an-item). A gas refuels vehicles nearby (6 blocks) with "Refuel vehicles nearby". Over half full the crawler is 15%% slower. The band on the tank shows the cargo's colour.
sva.tooltip.trailer.platform.summary=§7Crawler platform: §fcarries one small vehicle
sva.tooltip.trailer.platform.in=§7Carries: §f%s N %s
sva.tooltip.trailer.platform.none=§7Carries: §fnothing
sva.tooltip.trailer.platform.details=Fits the buggy and the hoverbike. Loading: right-click the crawler with the vehicle item, or "Load nearest" (your own empty vehicle within 5 blocks of the platform). It rides strapped down and slowly charges from the crawler (up to 32 EU/t, the crawler kept above 20%%). "Unload" puts it down beside the crawler with everything it had (charge, tuning, access, board number). Loaded, the crawler is 20%% slower.
sva.tooltip.trailer.charger.summary=§7Mobile charger: §f4 000 000 EU buffer
sva.tooltip.trailer.charger.in=§7Charge: §f%s / %s EU
sva.tooltip.trailer.charger.details=By day under the open sky its solar panels give 32 EU/t. On the move it charges from the crawler (up to 128 EU/t, the crawler kept above 20%%). It charges vehicles within 4 blocks of the trailer like an HV charging station, one at a time. Made for expeditions with the drill.
sva.tooltip.trailer.kind.howto=Right-click your own cargo crawler to hitch it (instead of the cargo trailer). The cargo screen gets a "Trailer" tab. Unhitch it there - it returns to your inventory with everything in it. Made on the Engineering Workbench from an empty cargo trailer.
