# The vehicle menu (key key.sva.menu) and the function keys
key.sva.menu=Vehicle menu
sva.fn.boost=Boost
sva.fn.boost.tip=Hoverbike - boost (sprint works too). Jet and tiltrotor in airplane mode - afterburner; shuttle and Singular Ship - boost flying forward. Burns hydrogen.
sva.fn.down=Descend
sva.fn.down.tip=Helicopter, shuttle, ship - down; plane - nose down. The sprint key (Ctrl) works too.
sva.fn.drill=Drill
sva.fn.drill.tip=Drill on / off. It digs while the vehicle drives forward; needs a drill head (the cargo screen's "Drill" tab).
sva.fn.mode=Mode
sva.fn.mode.tip=Drill vehicle - drill mode; tiltrotor - vertical / airplane; shuttle and ship - long-range mode.
sva.fn.mode.drill=Drill mode
sva.fn.mode.drill.tip=Drill vehicle: Tunnel / Ore only / Level - in turn.
sva.fn.mode.tilt=Flight mode
sva.fn.mode.tilt.tip=Tiltrotor: nacelles up (vertical mode, like a helicopter) or forward (airplane); about 2 s to turn.
sva.fn.mode.long=Long-range mode
sva.fn.mode.long.tip=Shuttle and Singular Ship: high up and fast, flies on deuterium instead of EU.
sva.fn.jump=Jump
sva.fn.jump.tip=Singular Ship: open a portal to the jump target (a Coordinator in the cargo, or home). A cooldown follows.
sva.fn.target=Jump target
sva.fn.target.tip=Singular Ship: the jump target - a Coordinator from the cargo, or home.
sva.fn.anchor=Anchor
sva.fn.anchor.tip=Gravity anchor: the Singular Ship holds perfectly still.
sva.fn.cloak=Invisibility
sva.fn.cloak.tip=The Singular Ship is invisible to mobs.
sva.fn.cruise=Cruise / autopilot
sva.fn.cruise.tip=Buggy, crawler, drill vehicle, hoverbike - holds the speed (wheel +-5 km/h, S or Space - off). Plane, jet, tiltrotor in airplane mode - holds heading and height (W/S/A/D - off).
sva.fn.cargo=Cargo
sva.fn.cargo.tip=The cargo / bunker screen while seated (the owner and those with the "Cargo" right).
sva.fn.map=Vehicle map
sva.fn.map.tip=A map round you: your vehicles and those you have access to.
